\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  The grace of God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 is well in abundance
\par He blesses all people
\par All those who worship
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Him with one great heart
\par shall receive his pardon
\par So then, all people who do commit
\par all kinds of sins against the Father
\par repent today.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Our Lord of Host
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 whose pow'r is great and strong,
\par has love for all mankind.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We need not be
\par so hardened in our hearts
\par which are hard as stone.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His gentle love shall soothe
\par all our hearts
\par and makes us to be good sons of God
\par \cf1 and to love him.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  He who has power
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 From  Heavens high above
\par Has a host of angels.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His love is deep;
\par Those of us on this earth,
\par He has honoured us all.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What praises can we ever give Him?
\par He who redeems us from all evil,
\par \pard      Thanks be to God.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

